            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">On <date when="1917-01-22">22 January 1917</date>, Harriet Weaver sent JJ a telegram telling him “the sheets from America had arrived that day” (mentioned in her letter to JJ of 26 January 1917, Firth 167). For context, see <rs type="letter" key="L_68297">JJ to Weaver, 4 June 1916</rs>, note 3, “cuttings”.</note>
